rust-proxmox-ldap (1.1.2-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * reject empty passwords before contacting the LDAP server. An empty
    password makes a simple bind unauthenticated, which servers allowing such
    binds report as success, so any existing directory user could pass the
    password check with just their user name.

 -- Proxmox Support Team <support@proxmox.com>  Mon, 02 Nov 2026 21:08:03 +0100

rust-proxmox-ldap (1.1.1-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * escape the user-provided user name when using it in the LDAP search
    filter that looks up the user DN.

  * log which user properties change when synchronizing an existing user,
    instead of only reporting that the user was updated.

 -- Proxmox Support Team <support@proxmox.com>  Tue, 14 Jul 2026 08:46:22 +0200

